---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="How aPaulogy collects and uses your information.">
  <div class="container-page py-16 prose-paper">
    <h1 class="text-5xl mb-6">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-[var(--color-muted)]">Last updated: August 2026</p>
    <p>aPaulogy respects your privacy. This policy explains what we collect and why.</p>
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Order details:</strong> your name, email, phone and shipping address, used to fulfil and support your order.</li>
      <li><strong>Payment data:</strong> handled entirely by Razorpay. We never see or store your full card details.</li>
      <li><strong>Newsletter:</strong> your email, if you choose to subscribe.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>How we use it</h2>
    <p>We use your information to process orders, provide support, and — with your consent — send occasional updates. We do not sell your data.</p>
    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>We use minimal, functional storage (such as your shopping cart) to make the site work. We do not run intrusive third-party advertising trackers.</p>
    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal data at any time by contacting us.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>For any privacy request, reach us via the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
